    "Quit Antigravity": "退出 Antigravity",
    "WSL distro not found": "未找到 WSL 发行版",
    "Antigravity opened on Windows instead.": "Antigravity 已在 Windows 环境中打开。",
    "Binary not found": "未找到二进制执行文件",
    "WSL setup failed": "WSL 配置失败",
    "Startup failed": "启动失败",
